{"message":"Your referral history shows no prior referrals, so the 2-bonus rolling 9-day limit will not reduce your eligibility. Based on the approximately $31,000 startup deposit, the best practical option is the Sky Blue startup account: you could earn $150, and the new business could receive a $250 welcome bonus. It is designed for startups and has no stated funding minimum in the referral information I found.

The higher-paying alternatives do not fit the stated funding amount: True Blue requires $50,000 for a $350 referral bonus, while Beige requires $100,000 for a $500 bonus. Navy Blue would pay $100 after a $5,000 deposit.

Before I can confirm that you can submit the Sky Blue referral, I need to know whether you have been a Rho-Bank checking customer long enough to meet that program’s tenure requirement. Also, your former partner must be a new Rho-Bank customer, live at a different registered address, and have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account. The $31,000 must be new money, the referral cannot be combined with another sign-up promotion, and only one referral code may be used."}
